{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13205020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13205020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1320502001:1":{"text":"저 개는... 왜 양을 이쪽으로 몰고 온 뒤에 도망친 걸까? 양치기 개인 줄 알았는데!","source_cn":"那只狗……它怎么把羊赶到我们身边之后就跑了？！满满还以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAA78F9FF2183EC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320502002:1":{"text":"치피, 아마 양치기 개 맞을 거야.","source_cn":"满满，它应该就是牧羊犬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BF96D2CB3C0520C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320502003:1":{"text":"「레오프론 풍습 도감」에서 봤는데, 시더 마을은 날씨가 춥고 겨울이 길어서, 주민들이 양을 많이 키운대. 그래서 거의 모든 집이 양치기 개를 기른다고 하더라고. ","source_cn":"我记得《耀光风土图鉴》上说，雪松镇天气寒冷，冬季也格外...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE427CA441CAF770A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320502004:1":{"text":"어쩌면 우리가 양을 주인에게 데려다 주길 바라는 걸지도 몰라.","source_cn":"或许它是希望我们能带这只羊找到主人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA996D46F0A211A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320502005:1":{"text":"...왜 직접 가지 않고? 우리는 주인이 어디에 있는지도 모르는걸?","source_cn":"……它为什么不自己找？我们又不知道它们的主人在哪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1AC0BF6E47D515C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320502006:1":{"text":"음, 어쩌면 다른 양을 찾으러 간 걸지도 몰라. 양을 한 마리만 기르지는 않을 테니까.","source_cn":"唔，大概是去找其他绵羊了吧？毕竟牧民不可能只有一只羊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55812869DB2A5B5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320502007:1":{"text":"우선 <style=\"highlight\">이 양의 주인</style>을 찾아보자. 이대로 놔두고 갈 순 없잖아.","source_cn":"先在附近找找<style=highlight>这只羊的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA003571D91B5356","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}